      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001889.wav",
      "sha256": "1966b67660dc516465a82ed630fc482132a13aedb08f1073e3aa5ea1ca8a42f8",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001891",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "拉卡·辛格 (Lakkha Singh) 还介绍了 chhappan bhog bhajan。歌手 Raju Khandelwal 陪同他身边。",
      "duration_seconds": 20.74,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001891.wav",
      "sha256": "0c50d33efce4ad18c796cf991c9aeb5d937624fb37c6b9d6540b282bc6155ef5",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001895-2",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "随着希腊知识的衰落，西方脱离了其希腊哲学和科学根源。",
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001895-2.wav",
      "sha256": "06649cceb6f4f752c6e3d668e92296a38e386247382998e0eb1a0605c5bc7c82",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001899-2",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "穆罕默德对尘世生活之外的事十分感兴趣。他以前经常到“努尔”（光明）山上一个叫做”希拉“的山洞里去冥想。",
      "duration_seconds": 15.72,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001899-2.wav",
      "sha256": "09cc580dcf33265814da2f351258606f9bf37e4669b0fbd35683c9f6ef5c1796",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001901",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "人工智能有很强的科幻色彩，但它其实是计算机科学非常重要的一个分支，研究的是机器的行为、学习和智能适应。",
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001901.wav",
      "sha256": "001787a4c1a5d3fa4d7f9502eb93a7c684801a2bed2bf6c3bea6aa44d0de8724",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001904",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "然而，由于文化交流迟缓，西方的时尚可能落后 25 到 30 年。",
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001904.wav",
      "sha256": "11250f993966d3258f3f885cd32cc11ea1ffbdf32c82f4b878be72e4677d6d39",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001911",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "同理，有了申根签证，你就不必分别向每个申根成员国申请签证，从而节省了时间、金钱和手续。",
      "duration_seconds": 9.84,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001911.wav",
      "sha256": "0b47fd56578b7bff25e9c3b90f3de5319a0cf8d1bb27ffe623e5586502625a7d",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001915-3",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "你可以乘坐 boda-boda（出租的摩托车）游览戈马（Goma）。短途车程的正常（当地）价格是 500 刚果法郎。",
      "duration_seconds": 17.66,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001915-3.wav",
      "sha256": "01b1356a68011f204eeee080239291f8e49add0f2cbc93fc17fb79cf4d762afc",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001919-3",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "这座城市也是攀登尼拉贡戈火山（Nyiragongo）以及非洲最便宜的山地大猩猩追踪项目的基地。",
      "duration_seconds": 11.7,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001919-3.wav",
      "sha256": "0e89f6f0a14a81fa9cc2cf5e8234c5d67de3de276ef0b434b67c384b6acf6ddd",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001921-2",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "另一方面，冰雪天气在很多国家都十分常见，全年交通也几乎不会中断。",
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001921-2.wav",
      "sha256": "05bb82dff04723336ce50340613ff62034f840bf5c05c713e8d6730097a6a97b",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001925-2",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "完成的工作大多是理论性的，但编写程序的目的，是为了模拟对人马座星系的观测。",
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001925-2.wav",
      "sha256": "075358c16b4bee406a054e26e717274267bb2668adb123e0cf8480411cd2b0dc",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001931",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "该服务经常用于航运，包括游艇以及有远程数据和语音需求的探险。",
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001931.wav",
      "sha256": "057a57232823a56a2df3f775eb62d1e60b058017af5471b7a54e6c487accf27a",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001936",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "佩里表示，他会“返回得克萨斯，评估今晚党团会议的结果，明确自己在这次较量中是否有胜算的余地”。但后来他又表示会继续参加竞选，并参加于 1 月 21 日在南卡罗莱纳州举行的初选。",
      "duration_seconds": 21.18,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
