      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001937-2.wav",
      "sha256": "0e6c5ddd003f96e5e165c61ea66dcfc80fafca9b921523fba177b71279b1d6db",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001943",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "压力越小，生命力就表现得越积极。每个人都有可能找到绝对的平静和满足。",
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001943.wav",
      "sha256": "10d3eb9eb5453a54e24471151459882a5bab76877da4eadf7125c07c6d80adc8",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001947",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "在军队到来之前，海地自 19 世纪初以来从未遇到过与该疾病有关的问题。",
      "duration_seconds": 10.5,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "path": "fleurs/cmn_hans_cn/test/fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001947.wav",
      "sha256": "0a6b80656a65604fb8cf3ecd5e9fdebfab2c157a1f13c43dc1c5effe01b1f3ed",
      "notes": "FLEURS cmn_hans_cn/test; gender=0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fleurs-cmn_hans_cn-test-001956-2",
      "language": "zh",
      "reference_text": "迄今为止，船运是跨洋运输大量人员和货物的最有效方式。",
      "duration_seconds": 14.42,
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
